# gcbot's env file: copy it to gcbot.env (gitignored) and pass that to the container
# (`docker run --env-file gcbot/gcbot.env`, or `env_file:` in compose). README.md has each setting.
# The alt's Steam refresh token: leave it empty when `node src/login.mjs --state <dir>` wrote
# <dir>/refresh-token into the directory mounted as /state; otherwise paste the token here.
# Never commit a filled-in copy.
STEAM_REFRESH_TOKEN=
# The image's defaults:
# GCBOT_STATE=/state
# GCBOT_PORT=8097
# GCBOT_HOST=0.0.0.0
